        "text": "Context: Architect for AWS Fargate for Amazon ECS Heading: Platform versions Function: explanation Text: AWS Fargate platform versions are used to refer to a specific runtime environment for Fargate task infrastructure. It is a combination of the kernel and container runtime versions. You select a platform version when you run a task or when you create a service to maintain a number of identical tasks.",
